# Artifacts are content-hashed byte-for-byte (SHA256SUMS). Force LF line
# endings on every text file so a checkout on any platform reproduces the
# exact bytes that were hashed (the v0.1.5 cross-platform checksum failure
# root cause: CRLF on Windows was normalized to LF by git, breaking the
# recorded hashes on Linux checkouts).
* text=auto eol=lf
